{"id": "3211022", "revid": "119536", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3211022", "title": "Dubai Tennis Championships 2025 \u2013 Dublu feminin", "text": "Dubai Tennis Championships 2025 \u2013 Dublu feminin a avut loc \u00een a doua jum\u0103tate a lunii februarie 2025. Dou\u0103zeci \u0219i opt de perechi de juc\u0103toare s-au \u00eenscris \u00een competi\u021bia de dublu a turneului de tenis de la Dubai disputat pe terenuri cu suprafa\u021b\u0103 dur\u0103. Storm Hunter \u0219i Kate\u0159ina Siniakov\u00e1 au fost campioanele \u00een exerci\u021biu, dar Hunter n-a participat \u00een acest an. \nKate\u0159ina Siniakov\u00e1 \u0219i Taylor Townsend au c\u00e2\u0219tigat titlul la dublu feminin la Dubai Tennis Championships 2025, \u00eenving\u00e2ndu-le pe Hsieh Su-wei \u0219i Je\u013cena Ostapenko \u00een final\u0103, cu 7\u20136(7\u20135), 6\u20134.\nCapi de serie.\nPrimii patru capi de serie au primit un bye \u00een runda a doua."}
