{"id": "3212289", "revid": "41997", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3212289", "title": "Sindromul Cockayne", "text": "Sindromul Cockayne este o tulburare genetic\u0103 rar\u0103, caracterizat\u0103 \u00een principal de tulbur\u0103ri de cre\u0219tere, deficit intelectual, dificult\u0103\u021bi neuromotorii \u0219i deficien\u021be de vedere \u0219i auz. Copiii au ceea ce se nume\u0219te \u201dfacies \u00een cap de pas\u0103re\u201d, av\u00e2nd o fa\u021b\u0103 \u00eemb\u0103tr\u00e2nit\u0103 prematur."}
{"id": "3212293", "revid": "41997", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3212293", "title": "Guy Burgess", "text": "Guy Burgess () a fost un diplomat britanic \u0219i agent MI6 care a fugit \u00een 1951 \u00een Uniunea Sovietic\u0103, unde a r\u0103mas p\u00e2n\u0103 la sf\u00e2r\u0219itul vie\u021bii.\nPovestea lui constituie subiectul filmului \"Another Country\" din 1984.\nBurgess a f\u0103cut parte din grupul \u201eCei Cinci de la Cambridge\u201d, cu rol semnificativ \u00een schimbul de informa\u021bii \u00eentre Lumea Occidental\u0103 \u0219i Blocul R\u0103s\u0103ritean."}
