{"id": "3213037", "revid": "119536", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3213037", "title": "Leucophaeus", "text": "Leucophaeus este un mic gen de pesc\u0103ru\u0219i de m\u0103rime medie, majoritatea av\u00e2nd un penaj \u00eenchis la culoare, de obicei cu semilune albe deasupra \u0219i sub ochi. Acestea au fost plasate \u00een genul \"Larus\" p\u00e2n\u0103 de cur\u00e2nd. Numele genului \"Leucophaeus\" provine din greaca veche \"leukos\", \u201ealb\u201d, \u0219i \"phaios\", \u201e\u00eentunecat\u201d. "}
